# Manual overrides, for discs the auto-detection can't place.
# One per line:   LABEL|key=value,key=value,...
# LABEL is the disc's volume label exactly as it appears in the log (video),
# or the value ripd.sh logged for an unidentified audio CD.
#
# The keys you provide must match whatever %tokens% PATTERN_VIDEO or
# PATTERN_AUDIO reference in config.sh. See docs/pattern-tokens.md.
#
# Video example (default pattern wants season, disc):
# SOME_WEIRD_LABEL|season=2,disc=5
#
# Audio example (default pattern wants artist, album):
# AudioCD-14tracks-1234567890|artist=Pixies,album=Doolittle
